\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f30\fs24\cf2\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\b\f28\fs32\expnd20\expndtw100 TH\'abNG T\'ad
\par }\pard \qc \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f28\fs20\expnd4\expndtw24 C\'f1A LI\'aaN B\'e9 BAN TCCBCP - B\'e9 T\'b5I CH\'ddNH S\'e8 97/TTLB/TCCBCP-TC NG\'b5
Y 16 TH\'b8NG 8 N\'a8M 1995
\par H\'ad\'edNG D\'c9N TH\'f9C HI\'d6N NGH\'de \'ae\'deNH S\'e8 50/CP NG\'b5Y 26-7-1995 C\'f1A CH\'ddNH PH\'f1 V\'d2 CH\'d5 \'ae\'e9 SINH HO\'b9T PH\'dd \'ae\'e8I V\'edI C\'b8N B\'e9 X\'b7, PH\'ad\'eaNG, 
\par }\pard \qc \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f28\fs20\expnd4\expndtw24 TH\'de TR\'caN
\par }\pard \qc \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f28\fs20\expnd4\expndtw24 
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {Ng\'b5y 26-7-1995 Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 \'ae\'b7 ban h\'b5nh Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh s\'e8 50/CP v\'d2 ch\'d5 \'ae\'e9 sinh ho
\'b9t ph\'dd \'ae\'e8i v\'edi c\'b8n b\'e9 x\'b7, ph\'ad\'eang, th\'de tr\'can. Trong qu\'b8 tr\'d7nh x\'a9y d\'f9ng Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh \'ae\'b7 trao \'ae\'e6i th\'e8ng nh\'cat \'fd ki\'d5n v\'edi c\'b8c c\'ac quan c\'e3 li\'aan quan \'eb Trung \'ad\'ac
ng, Li\'aan B\'e9: Ban T\'e6 ch\'f8c - C\'b8n b\'e9 Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 v\'b5 B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n th\'f9c hi\'d6n nh\'ad sau:
\par }\pard \qc \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl240\slmult0\keepn\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f28\fs22 I- S\'e8 L\'ad\'eeNG C\'b8N B\'e9 L\'b5M C\'abNG T\'b8C \'a7\'b6NG, C\'abNG T\'b8C CH\'dd
NH QUY\'d2N
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {1. X\'b7, ph\'ad\'eang, th\'de tr\'can l\'b5 \'ae\'acn v\'de h\'b5nh ch\'ddnh c\'cap c\'ac s\'eb (g\'e4i chung l
\'b5 c\'cap x\'b7). C\'b8n b\'e9 x\'b7 bao g\'e5m nh\'f7ng c\'b8n b\'e9 \'ae\'ad\'eec b\'c7u c\'f6 theo nhi\'d6m k\'fa v\'b5 c\'b8n b\'e9 chuy\'aan m\'abn nghi\'d6p v\'f4 l\'b5 nh\'f7ng ng\'ad\'eai ch\'deu tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m l\'b7nh \'ae\'b9o, t\'e6 ch\'f8
c v\'cbn \'ae\'e9ng nh\'a9n d\'a9n th\'f9c hi\'d6n c\'b8c ch\'f1 tr\'ad\'acng ch\'ddnh s\'b8ch c\'f1a \'a7\'b6ng, ph\'b8p lu\'cbt c\'f1a Nh\'b5 n\'ad\'edc \'eb c\'ac s\'eb. C\'b8n b\'e9 x\'b7 v\'f5a c\'abng t\'b8c v\'f5a g\'ben li\'d2n v\'edi s\'b6n xu
\'cat v\'b5 \'ae\'eai s\'e8ng c\'f1a nh\'a9n d\'a9n \'ae\'dea ph\'ad\'acng. \'a7\'d3 t\'f5ng b\'ad\'edc th\'f9c hi\'d6n Ngh\'de quy\'d5t 8 c\'f1a Trung \'ad\'acng \'a7\'b6ng kho\'b8 VII "... Ki\'d6n to\'b5n ch\'ddnh quy\'d2n c\'cap x\'b7, gi\'b6i quy\'d5
t v\'can \'ae\'d2 ng\'a9n s\'b8ch v\'b5 t\'f5ng b\'ad\'edc chuy\'aan nghi\'d6p ho\'b8 m\'e9t s\'e8 v\'de tr\'dd c\'abng t\'b8c \'eb x\'b7...", \'ae\'e5ng th\'eai g\'e3p ph\'c7n c\'b6i thi\'d6n \'ae\'eai s\'e8ng c\'b8n b\'e9 x\'b7, ph\'ef h\'eep v\'edi 
\'aei\'d2u ki\'d6n kinh t\'d5 hi\'d6n nay, Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 \'ae\'b7 ban h\'b5nh Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh s\'e8 50/CP ng\'b5y 26-7-1995 v\'d2 ch\'d5 \'ae\'e9 sinh ho\'b9t ph\'dd \'ae\'e8i v\'edi c\'b8n b\'e9 x\'b7, \'ae\'ad\'eec th\'f9c hi\'d6n th\'e8ng nh\'ca
t trong c\'b6 n\'ad\'edc t\'f5 ng\'b5y 1-7-1995.
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {2. Vi\'d6c quy \'ae\'denh s\'e8 l\'ad\'eeng c\'b8n b\'e9 v\'b5 m\'f8c ph\'f4 c\'cap sinh ho\'b9t ph\'dd cho c\'b8
n b\'e9 x\'b7 l\'c7n n\'b5y th\'d3 hi\'d6n r\'e2 s\'f9 quan t\'a9m v\'b5 c\'e8 g\'beng l\'edn c\'f1a \'a7\'b6ng v\'b5 Nh\'b5 n\'ad\'edc ta \'ae\'e8i v\'edi c\'cap c\'ac s\'eb. U\'fb ban nh\'a9n d\'a9n c\'b8c c\'cap c\'c7n ch\'d8 \'ae\'b9o vi\'d6c s\'bep x
\'d5p b\'e9 m\'b8y ch\'ddnh quy\'d2n x\'b7 tinh g\'e4n, \'e6n \'ae\'denh v\'b5 chuy\'aan m\'abn ho\'b8 m\'e9t s\'e8 c\'b8n b\'e9 c\'abng t\'b8c \'eb x\'b7 nh\'ad c\'b8n b\'e9 V\'a8n ph\'dfng U\'fb ban nh\'a9n d\'a9n, c\'b8n b\'e9 \'ae\'dea ch\'ddnh, c\'b8
n b\'e9 h\'e9 t\'dech t\'ad ph\'b8p, h\'e9 kh\'c8u, c\'b8n b\'e9 t\'b5i ch\'ddnh x\'b7... \'ae\'d3 th\'f9c hi\'d6n t\'e8t ch\'f8c n\'a8ng qu\'b6n l\'fd h\'b5nh ch\'ddnh Nh\'b5 n\'ad\'edc tr\'aan c\'b8c l\'dcnh v\'f9c c\'abng t\'b8c \'eb c\'ac s\'eb.

\par 3. S\'e8 l\'ad\'eeng c\'b8n b\'e9 \'ae\'ad\'eec b\'e8 tr\'dd theo \'a7i\'d2u 1 trong Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh s\'e8 50/CP c\'f1a Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1.
\par - C\'b8c ch\'f8c danh c\'b8n b\'e9 \'a7\'b6ng v\'b5 ch\'ddnh quy\'d2n x\'b7 \'ae\'ad\'eec b\'e8 tr\'dd nh\'ad sau:
\par C\'b8n b\'e9 \'a7\'b6ng u\'fb x\'b7: 2
\par H\'e9i \'ae\'e5ng nh\'a9n d\'a9n x\'b7: 2
\par U\'fb ban nh\'a9n d\'a9n x\'b7: 7 (theo Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh 174/CP)
\par C\'b8n b\'e9 chuy\'aan m\'abn nghi\'d6p v\'f4: 4
\par Ch\'f8c danh c\'b8n b\'e9 M\'c6t tr\'cbn v\'b5 c\'b8c \'aeo\'b5n th\'d3 \'eb x\'b7 do c\'b8c \'aeo\'b5n th\'d3 quy \'ae\'denh kh\'abng k\'d3 trong s\'e8 l\'ad\'eeng n\'e3i tr\'aan.
\par U\'fb ban nh\'a9n d\'a9n t\'d8nh, th\'b5nh ph\'e8 tr\'f9c thu\'e9c Trung \'ad\'acng c\'a8n c\'f8 v\'b5o s\'e8 d\'a9n, di\'d6n t\'ddch, kh\'e8i l\'ad\'eeng c\'abng vi\'d6c, \'ae\'dea h\'d7nh ph\'f8c t\'b9p \'aei l\'b9i kh\'e3 kh\'a8n, t\'d7nh h\'d7nh ch
\'ddnh tr\'de, kinh t\'d5, \'ae\'c6c \'aei\'d3m d\'a9n t\'e9c, t\'abn gi\'b8o, an ninh, tr\'cbt t\'f9 an to\'b5n x\'b7 h\'e9i \'ae\'d3 b\'e8 tr\'dd c\'b8n b\'e9 cho ph\'ef h\'eep v\'edi t\'f5ng lo\'b9i x\'b7, ph\'ad\'eang, th\'de tr\'can \'eb \'ae\'dea ph
\'ad\'acng.
\par Nh\'f7ng x\'b7 \'ae\'ad\'eec b\'e8 tr\'dd 16, 18, 20 c\'b8n b\'e9 l\'b5 m\'f8c t\'e8i \'aea cho t\'f5ng lo\'b9i x\'b7 theo quy \'ae\'denh c\'f1a Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh s\'e8 50/CP U\'fb ban nh\'a9n d\'a9n t\'d8nh, huy\'d6n h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n b\'e8 tr\'dd t
\'a8ng c\'ad\'eang cho nh\'f7ng l\'dcnh v\'f9c c\'e3 kh\'e8i l\'ad\'eeng c\'abng vi\'d6c l\'edn nh\'ad x\'b7 bi\'aan gi\'edi, h\'b6i \'ae\'b6o c\'e3 th\'d3 b\'e8 tr\'dd m\'e9t ph\'e3 c\'abng an, m\'e9t ph\'e3 x\'b7 \'ae\'e9i, x\'b7 c\'e3 s\'e8 l\'ad\'ee
ng b\'b6o tr\'ee x\'b7 h\'e9i l\'edn c\'e3 th\'d3 b\'e8 tr\'dd m\'e9t c\'b8n b\'e9 lao \'ae\'e9ng th\'ad\'acng binh - x\'b7 h\'e9i, x\'b7 c\'e3 ngu\'e5n thu l\'edn c\'e3 th\'d3 b\'e8 tr\'dd th\'aam m\'e9t c\'b8n b\'e9 t\'b5i ch\'ddnh, x\'b7 c\'e3 phong tr
\'b5o v\'a8n ho\'b8 th\'d3 d\'f4c th\'d3 thao ph\'b8t tri\'d3n v\'b5 c\'b8c m\'c6t c\'abng t\'b8c kh\'b8c x\'d0t th\'cay c\'c7n thi\'d5t th\'d7 c\'e3 th\'d3 b\'e8 tr\'dd m\'e9t c\'b8n b\'e9 ph\'f4 tr\'b8ch.
\par Nh\'f7ng x\'b7 \'ae\'ad\'eec quy \'ae\'denh 12 ho\'c6c 14 ch\'f8c danh c\'c7n b\'e8 tr\'dd c\'b8n b\'e9 ki\'aam nhi\'d6m cho ph\'ef h\'eep \'ae\'d3 b\'b6o \'ae\'b6m c\'b8c m\'c6t c\'abng t\'b8c c\'f1a x\'b7 \'ae\'d2u c\'e3 ng\'ad\'eai \'ae\'b6m nhi\'d6m.

\par - Ph\'ad\'eang, th\'de tr\'can b\'e8 tr\'dd c\'b8n b\'e9 cho ph\'ef h\'eep v\'edi y\'aau c\'c7u qu\'b6n l\'fd \'ae\'ab th\'de nh\'adng kh\'abng v\'ad\'eet qu\'b8 15 ng\'ad\'eai (k\'d3 c\'b6 s\'e8 c\'b8n b\'e9 trong bi\'aan ch\'d5 Nh\'b5 n\'ad\'edc \'ae
ang c\'abng t\'b8c t\'b9i ph\'ad\'eang).
\par \'a7\'e8i v\'edi c\'b8n b\'e9 chuy\'aan m\'abn c\'abng t\'b8c t\'b9i x\'b7 nh\'ad: y t\'d5, m\'c9u gi\'b8o, nh\'b5 tr\'ce, thu\'d5, c\'abng t\'b8c t\'b9i x\'b7 g\'e5m c\'b6 di\'d6n h\'ad\'ebng ti\'d2n l\'ad\'acng v\'b5 sinh ho\'b9t ph\'dd kh\'abng thu\'e9
c \'ae\'e8i t\'ad\'eeng th\'f9c hi\'d6n \'eb Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh s\'e8 50/CP v\'b5 Th\'abng t\'ad n\'b5y.
\par \'a7\'e8i v\'edi c\'b8n b\'e9 b\'adu \'aei\'d6n x\'b7 do ng\'b5nh b\'adu \'aei\'d6n tr\'b6 ph\'f4 c\'cap, th\'eai gian chuy\'d3n c\'abng v\'a8n cho x\'b7 th\'d7 h\'ad\'ebng ph\'f4 c\'cap theo ch\'d5 \'ae\'e9 h\'eep \'ae\'e5ng do Ch\'f1 t\'dech U\'fb
 ban nh\'a9n d\'a9n x\'b7 quy\'d5t \'ae\'denh.
\par }\pard \qc \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl240\slmult0\keepn\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f28\fs22 II- M\'f8C SINH HO\'b9T PH\'dd H\'b5NG TH\'b8NG \'ae\'e8I V\'edI C\'b8N B\'e9 X\'b7 \'aeANG C
\'abNG T\'b8C V\'b5 TR\'ee C\'caP CHO C\'b8N B\'e9 X\'b7 NGH\'d8 VI\'d6C.
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {1. M\'f8c sinh ho\'b9t ph\'dd \'ae\'e8i v\'edi c\'b8n b\'e9 x\'b7 \'aeang c\'abng t\'b8c:
\par - B\'dd th\'ad \'a7\'b6ng u\'fb (B\'dd th\'ad chi b\'e9 x\'b7 n\'aci ch\'ada c\'e3 \'a7\'b6ng u\'fb x\'b7), Ch\'f1 t\'dech H\'e9i \'ae\'e5ng nh\'a9n d\'a9n, Ch\'f1 t\'dech U\'fb ban nh\'a9n d\'a9n x\'b7 m\'f8c: 200.000 \'ae\'e5ng/th\'b8ng.
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {- Ph\'e3 B\'dd th\'ad \'a7\'b6ng u\'fb x\'b7 (ho\'c6c th\'ad\'eang tr\'f9c \'a7\'b6ng u\'fb x\'b7), Ph\'e3 Ch\'f1 t
\'dech H\'e9i \'ae\'e5ng nh\'a9n d\'a9n, Ph\'e3 Ch\'f1 t\'dech U\'fb ban nh\'a9n d\'a9n, x\'b7 \'ae\'e9i tr\'ad\'ebng, tr\'ad\'ebng c\'abng an x\'b7 m\'f8c sinh ho\'b9t ph\'dd 180.000 \'ae\'e5ng/th\'b8ng.
\par - Tr\'ad\'ebng c\'b8c \'aeo\'b5n th\'d3 nh\'a9n d\'a9n x\'b7: M\'c6t tr\'cbn T\'e6 qu\'e8c, H\'e9i ph\'f4 n\'f7, \'a7o\'b5n thanh ni\'aan C\'e9ng s\'b6n H\'e5 Ch\'dd Minh, H\'e9i N\'abng d\'a9n v\'b5 H\'e9i C\'f9u chi\'d5n binh m\'f8c 180.000 \'ae\'e5
ng/th\'b8ng.
\par Kinh ph\'dd ho\'b9t \'ae\'e9ng c\'f1a m\'e7i \'aeo\'b5n th\'d3 do qu\'fc c\'f1a \'aeo\'b5n th\'d3 chi, n\'d5u thi\'d5u th\'d7 ng\'a9n s\'b8ch x\'b7 h\'e7 tr\'ee.
\par - C\'b8c ch\'f8c danh c\'dfn l\'b9i m\'f8c sinh ho\'b9t ph\'dd: 160.000 \'ae\'e5ng/th\'b8ng.
\par C\'b8c ch\'f8c danh \'ae\'ad\'eec b\'c7u c\'f6 v\'b5 c\'b8n b\'e9 chuy\'aan m\'abn nghi\'d6p v\'f4 sau n\'a8m n\'a8m c\'abng t\'b8c li\'aan t\'f4c n\'d5u \'ae\'ad\'eec t\'b8i c\'f6 v\'b5 ti\'d5p t\'f4c c\'abng t\'b8c chuy\'aan m\'abn nghi\'d6p v\'f4 \'ae
\'ad\'eec h\'ad\'ebng ph\'f4 c\'cap 5% c\'f1a m\'f8c sinh ho\'b9t ph\'dd \'aeang h\'ad\'ebng (t\'ddnh t\'f5 n\'a8m th\'f8 6 tr\'eb \'aei, th\'f9c hi\'d6n t\'f5 1-7-1995).
\par 2. Nh\'f7ng c\'b8n b\'e9 c\'abng t\'b8c x\'b7 tr\'ad\'edc \'ae\'a9y \'ae\'b7 \'ae\'ad\'eec gi\'b6i quy\'d5t ngh\'d8 vi\'d6c theo Quy\'d5t \'ae\'denh s\'e8 130/CP ng\'b5y 20-6-1975 v\'b5 Quy\'d5t \'ae\'denh s\'e8 111/H\'a7BT ng\'b5y 13-10-1981 c\'f1a Ch
\'ddnh ph\'f1 tr\'ad\'edc khi ban h\'b5nh Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh 46/CP ng\'b5y 23-6-1993, theo Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh s\'e8 50/CP \'ae\'ad\'eec h\'ad\'ebng c\'b8c m\'f8c tr\'ee c\'cap sau:
\par - Nguy\'aan B\'dd th\'ad, Ch\'f1 t\'dech U\'fb ban nh\'a9n d\'a9n x\'b7 \'ae\'ad\'eec tr\'ee c\'cap 100.000 \'ae\'e5ng/th\'b8ng.
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {- Ph\'e3 B\'dd th\'ad, Ph\'e3 Ch\'f1 t\'dech U\'fb ban nh\'a9n d\'a9n x\'b7, x\'b7 \'ae\'e9i tr\'ad\'ebng, tr\'ad
\'ebng c\'abng an x\'b7: 90.000 \'ae\'e5ng/th\'b8ng.
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {- C\'b8c ch\'f8c danh kh\'b8c: 80.000 \'ae\'abng/th\'b8ng.
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {3. T\'f5 ng\'b5y 1-7-1995 th\'f9c hi\'d6n Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh s\'e8 50/CP c\'f1a Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1, nh\'f7ng c\'b8n b
\'e9 x\'b7 l\'b5m vi\'d6c (bao g\'e5m c\'b8n b\'e9 \'a7\'b6ng, ch\'ddnh quy\'d2n, \'aeo\'b5n th\'d3, c\'b8n b\'e9 chuy\'aan m\'abn) c\'e3 th\'eai gian c\'abng t\'b8c li\'aan t\'f4c t\'b9i x\'b7 t\'f5 5 n\'a8m tr\'eb l\'aan, kh\'abng vi ph\'b9m k\'fb lu
\'cbt t\'f5 h\'d7nh th\'f8c c\'b6nh c\'b8o tr\'eb l\'aan ho\'c6c b\'de b\'b7i nhi\'d6m, khi ngh\'d8 vi\'d6c do kh\'abng \'ae\'ad\'eec t\'b8i c\'f6, kh\'abng \'ae\'ad\'eec s\'bep x\'d5p l\'b5m vi\'d6c th\'d7 Ch\'f1 t\'dech U\'fb ban nh\'a9n d\'a9n c\'ca
p tr\'aan tr\'f9c ti\'d5p quy\'d5t \'ae\'denh cho ngh\'d8 vi\'d6c v\'b5 h\'ad\'ebng ch\'d5 \'ae\'e9 tr\'ee c\'cap m\'e9t l\'c7n sau khi \'ae\'b7 trao \'ae\'e6i th\'e8ng nh\'cat v\'edi Tr\'ad\'ebng Ban t\'e6 ch\'f8c ch\'ddnh quy\'d2n c\'cap t\'d8nh. M\'f8
c tr\'ee c\'cap m\'e7i n\'a8m c\'abng t\'b8c \'ae\'ad\'eec tr\'ee c\'cap m\'e9t th\'b8ng sinh ho\'b9t ph\'dd \'aeang h\'ad\'ebng. \'a7\'e8i v\'edi \'ae\'e8i t\'ad\'eeng \'ae\'ad\'eec h\'ad\'ebng ph\'f4 c\'cap 5% c\'f1a m\'f8c sinh ho\'b9t ph\'dd \'ae\'ad
\'eec c\'e9ng th\'aam kho\'b6n ph\'f4 c\'cap n\'b5y \'ae\'d3 t\'ddnh tr\'ee c\'cap ngh\'d8 vi\'d6c.
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {Nh\'f7ng c\'b8n b\'e9 h\'ad\'ebng ch\'d5 \'ae\'e9 h\'adu tr\'dd, ngh\'d8 m\'cat s\'f8c, ngh\'d8 th\'abi vi\'d6
c theo ch\'d5 \'ae\'e9 tr\'ee c\'cap m\'e9t l\'c7n nay l\'b9i tham gia ho\'b9t \'ae\'e9ng c\'abng t\'b8c \'eb x\'b7, \'ae\'b6m nh\'cbn ch\'f8c danh n\'b5o \'ae\'ad\'eec h\'ad\'ebng m\'f8c sinh ho\'b9t ph\'dd c\'f1a ch\'f8c danh \'ae\'e3 t\'b9i x\'b7
, khi ngh\'d8 kh\'abng \'ae\'ad\'eec h\'ad\'ebng kho\'b6n tr\'ee c\'cap m\'e9t l\'c7n quy \'ae\'denh t\'b9i \'a7i\'d2u 5 Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh s\'e8 50/CP.
\par }\pard \qc \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl240\slmult0\keepn\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f28\fs22 III- T\'e6 CH\'f8C QU\'b6N L\'fd C\'caP PH\'b8T THANH TO\'b8N SINH HO\'b9T PH\'dd V\'b5 TR
\'ee C\'caP C\'b8N B\'e9 NGH\'d8 VI\'d6C:
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {1. Ngu\'e5n kinh ph\'dd tr\'b6 sinh ho\'b9t ph\'dd v\'b5 tr\'ee c\'cap cho c\'b8n b\'e9 ngh\'d8 vi\'d6c.
\par C\'b8c kho\'b6n chi tr\'aan \'ae\'ad\'eec chi t\'f5 ng\'a9n s\'b8ch x\'b7, ng\'a9n s\'b8ch x\'b7 ph\'b6i chu\'c8n b\'de ngu\'e5n \'ae\'d3 chi cho c\'b8c kho\'b6n \'ae\'e3 \'ae\'f3ng ch\'d5 \'ae\'e9 v\'b5 th\'eai gian. Tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep ngu\'e5n thu c
\'f1a x\'b7 kh\'abng \'ae\'f1 chi th\'ad\'eang xuy\'aan th\'d7 ng\'a9n s\'b8ch c\'cap tr\'aan xem x\'d0t b\'e6 sung ngu\'e5n \'ae\'d3 chi. Tr\'ad\'edc m\'bet B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh ch\'d8 xem x\'d0t b\'e6 sung c\'f4 th\'d3 cho vi\'d6c chi tr\'b6 sinh ho
\'b9t ph\'dd v\'b5 tr\'ee c\'cap cho c\'b8n b\'e9 ngh\'d8 vi\'d6c \'ae\'e8i v\'edi c\'b8c x\'b7 mi\'d2n n\'f3i, c\'b8c x\'b7 c\'e3 kh\'e3 kh\'a8n \'eb c\'b8c t\'d8nh thu\'e9c di\'d6n ph\'b6i b\'e6 sung ng\'a9n s\'b8ch t\'f5 ng\'a9n s\'b8ch Trung \'ad\'ac
ng. C\'b8c t\'d8nh, th\'b5nh ph\'e8 tr\'f9c thu\'e9c Trung \'ad\'acng ch\'d8 \'ae\'b9o c\'b8c x\'b7 x\'a9y d\'f9ng ng\'a9n s\'b8ch, khai th\'b8c ngu\'e5n thu \'ae\'d3 \'ae\'b6m b\'b6o ngu\'e5n kinh ph\'dd chi tr\'b6 \'ae\'f1, k\'dep th\'eai cho c\'b8n b
\'e9. Ri\'aang ngu\'e5n kinh ph\'dd 1995 \'ae\'e8i v\'edi c\'b8c t\'d8nh, th\'b5nh ph\'e8 tr\'f9c thu\'e9c Trung \'ad\'acng thu\'e9c di\'d6n b\'e6 sung t\'f5 ng\'a9n s\'b8ch Trung \'ad\'acng l\'cbp d\'f9 to\'b8n kho\'b6n ch\'aanh l\'d6ch t\'a8ng l\'aa
n do th\'f9c hi\'d6n Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh s\'e8 50/CP t\'f5 1-7-1995 \'ae\'d3 B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh b\'e6 sung kinh ph\'dd.
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {2. L\'cbp d\'f9 to\'b8n v\'b5 th\'f9c hi\'d6n chi tr\'b6, k\'d5t to\'b8n h\'b5ng n\'a8m.
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {Sinh ho\'b9t ph\'dd cho c\'b8n b\'e9 x\'b7 v\'b5 tr\'ee c\'cap c\'b8n b\'e9 ngh\'d8 vi\'d6c ph\'b6i \'ae\'ad\'eec l
\'cbp d\'f9 to\'b8n trong d\'f9 to\'b8n ng\'a9n s\'b8ch x\'b7 h\'b5ng n\'a8m \'ae\'f3ng theo n\'e9i dung th\'abng t\'ad h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n n\'b5y (bi\'d3u s\'e8 1, 2 \'ae\'ddnh k\'ccm).
\par Sinh ho\'b9t ph\'dd v\'b5 tr\'ee c\'cap c\'b8n b\'e9 ngh\'d8 vi\'d6c \'ae\'ad\'eec chi tr\'b6 tr\'f9c ti\'d5p \'ae\'d5n t\'f5ng ng\'ad\'eai.
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {C\'b8c kho\'b6n chi v\'d2 sinh ho\'b9t ph\'dd v\'b5 tr\'ee c\'cap c\'b8n b\'e9 ngh\'d8 vi\'d6c \'ae\'ad\'eec h\'b9
ch to\'b8n, quy\'d5t to\'b8n theo m\'f4c l\'f4c ng\'a9n s\'b8ch x\'b7 hi\'d6n h\'b5nh.
\par }\pard \qc \fi567\li0\ri0\sb120\sa120\sl240\slmult0\keepn\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f28\fs22 IV- T\'e6 CH\'f8C TH\'f9C HI\'d6N:
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {Th\'abng t\'ad n\'b5y c\'e3 hi\'d6u l\'f9c thi h\'b5nh t\'f5 ng\'b5y 1-7-1995 v\'b5 thay th\'d5 Th\'abng t\'ad s
\'e8 22/LBTT Li\'aan B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh - Ban T\'e6 ch\'f8c - C\'b8n b\'e9 Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 ng\'b5y 9-10-1993.
\par }\pard \qj \fi567\li0\ri0\sa120\sl240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx540\tx2250\tx2790\tx3600\tx5670\tx6030\tx7200\nooverflow\faroman\rin0\lin0\itap0 {U\'fb ban nh\'a9n d\'a9n t\'d8nh, th\'b5nh ph\'e8 tr\'f9c thu\'e9c Trung \'ad\'acng c\'a8n c\'f8 v\'b5o Ngh\'de 
\'ae\'denh s\'e8 50/CP ng\'b5y 26-7-1995 c\'f1a Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1, v\'b5o Th\'abng t\'ad Li\'aan B\'e9 h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n v\'b5 c\'a8n c\'f8 v\'b5o t\'d7nh h\'d7nh th\'f9c t\'d5 c\'f1a \'ae\'dea ph\'ad\'acng \'ae\'d3 h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n U\'fb ban nh\'a9n d
\'a9n c\'b8c c\'cap trong vi\'d6c quy \'ae\'denh s\'e8 l\'ad\'eeng v\'b5 nhi\'d6m v\'f4 c\'b8c ch\'f8c danh c\'b8n b\'e9 \'eb t\'f5ng lo\'b9i x\'b7, b\'b6o \'ae\'b6m ch\'cap h\'b5nh nghi\'aam ch\'d8nh Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh c\'f1a Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1.
\par Qu\'b8 tr\'d7nh th\'f9c hi\'d6n c\'b8c t\'d8nh, th\'b5nh ph\'e8 tr\'f9c thu\'e9c Trung \'ad\'acng c\'c7n s\'ac k\'d5t, nh\'cbn x\'d0t, \'ae\'b8nh gi\'b8 k\'d5t qu\'b6 v\'b5 g\'f6i b\'b8o c\'b8o v\'d2 Ban T\'e6 ch\'f8c - C\'b8n b\'e9 Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1
. Qua th\'f9c hi\'d6n c\'e3 kh\'e3 kh\'a8n ho\'c6c c\'e3 \'aei\'d2u g\'d7 c\'c7n b\'e6 sung, \'ae\'d2 ngh\'de c\'b8c \'ae\'dea ph\'ad\'acng ph\'b6n \'b8nh v\'d2 Li\'aan B\'e9 \'ae\'d3 c\'e3 h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n gi\'b6i quy\'d5t.
\par 
